<div class="row mb-5 align-items-center g-4">
    <div class="col-lg-7">
        <p class="section-kicker">Planning</p>
        <h2 class="h3 fw-bold mb-3">Architectural Production Planning</h2>
        <p>
            Transform demand into feasible production reality. Our MRP engine calculates exactly
            what to buy and when to start production, based on sales orders, lead times, and stock.
            By optimizing the production sequence to minimize changeovers and maximize utilization,
            your facility operates at peak efficiency while maintaining lean inventory.
        </p>
        <p class="mb-0">
            Capacity planning by work center ensures schedules are always achievable, identifying
            bottlenecks before they impact customer delivery dates.
        </p>
    </div>
