        <p class="section-kicker">Compliance</p>
        <h2 class="h3 fw-bold mb-3">Regulatory Compliance & Batch Genealogy</h2>
        <p>
            Secure your regulatory "Right to Operate" in sensitive industries. WHO GMP and MCAZ
            standards are enforced through locked-down quality workflows and non-conformance staging.
            In the event of a quality incident, the Batch Traceability engine provides immediate
            genealogy — which raw materials were used, which customers received the product.
        </p>
        <p class="mb-0">
            From quarantine management to Certificate of Analysis generation, quality assurance
            is hard-wired into the production lifecycle.
        </p>
